  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Presents the author's mother's memories of internment in several concentration and extermination camps in World War II. Stories of happy memories contrast with the horror of the holocaust in an artistic, emotional, and interactive experience for the reader.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="546" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Czech text in Eva Kellner's script opposite Tatana Kellner's translation.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
