  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Last page, 1/2 cm. thick, includes a three-dimensional forearm and hand, cast in handmade paper, from Eva Kellner's arm. Text pages are die cut to fit over cast.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
